## Why Asked
Tests project management, cross-functional coordination, and problem-solving under pressure
## Key Concepts
Critical path method, resource allocation, risk mitigation, timeline optimization
## Code Example
```
class ProjectReplan {
  calculateCriticalPath(teams) {
    return teams.filter(team => team.isBlocking).sort((a, b) => a.delay - b.delay)
  }
}
```
